[Mission.Objectives]
Сrush the enemy
[Mission.Description]
Lieutenant Colonel Waters! You must carry out an offensive to crush the enemy at the village of Sidi Bou Zid.
[Mission.Success]
The offensive has been a success! The enemy is fleeing!
[Mission.Failed]
Retreat! Our troops have been defeated!
[Submission1.Objectives]
Free the village
[Submission1.Description]
Free the village from enemy troops.
[Submission1.Success]
The village has been freed from invaders.
[Submission1.Failed]
We have failed to dislodge the enemy from the village!
[Submission2.Objectives]
Re-establish contact
[Submission2.Description]
Send an infantry unit to the howitzer artillery position to re-establish contact.
[Submission2.Success]
Contact has been re-established.
[Submission2.Failed]
We have failed to re-establish contact with the artillery!
[Submission3.Objectives]
Protect the artillery
[Submission3.Description]
Prevent the enemy from capturing the artillery.
[Submission3.Success]
The enemy has failed to capture the artillery!
[Submission3.Failed]
The enemy has captured the artillery!
[Submission4.Objectives]
Capture the artillery
[Submission4.Description]
Retake the artillery position!
[Submission4.Success]
The artillery is ours again!
[Submission4.Failed]
The enemy still controls the artillery!
[Submission5.Objectives]
Destroy the ambush
[Submission5.Description]
Destroy the ambush
[Submission5.Success]
Ambush has been destroyed!
[Submission5.Failed]
Ambush has not been destroyed!
[Submission8.Objectives]
Destroy the advancing enemy forces
[Submission8.Description]
The enemy has launched a counter-offensive to blunt our attack at Sidi Bou Zid. Destroy the advancing enemy forces!
[Submission8.Success]
The advancing enemy forces have been destroyed!
[Submission8.Failed]
Our troops have been crushed by the advancing enemy forces!
